                                                "sense_id": "b455dd83-34a3-3899-94eb-0729d839a18c",
                                                "text": "[…] 1919, a time when African American hopes for a just future following their service in World War I were dashed by violent reassertions of white supremacy, including the efflorescence and expansion of the KKK into the Midwestern and northwestern U.S."
                                            }
                                        ]
